_Last updated: {{DATE}}_

Curated references and the prioritized idea roadmap. It is a **human and setup reference**: it is never
compiled into a spawn, and no worker reads it to choose a unit. You read it at setup and at review, and
what you want tried goes into `results/JOURNAL.md` §What to try next and why — where the next worker
looks. A worker opens it only to cite a source. Literature ideas are suggestions; they do not override
the evidence on the ledger.

