> Sourcing: prefer each paper's arXiv version. Read the `ar5iv.org/abs/<id>` HTML or LaTeX source for
> clean equations; avoid publisher PDFs. When only a PDF exists, convert it with a
> scientific-PDF→markdown tool (`marker` / `nougat` / `docling` / `pymupdf4llm`) and cache the result.

